IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0003.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 CREDIT-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    05 ANNUAL-INCOME      PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 CREDIT-LIMIT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM ASSIGN-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-LIMIT=" CREDIT-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
ASSIGN-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 750
            COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 0.25
        WHEN CREDIT-SCORE >= 680
            COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 0.15
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 1000.00 TO CREDIT-LIMIT
    END-EVALUATE.
